    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for pluggable embedding providers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implement this to integrate any embedding model (OpenAI text-embedding-3, Sentence Transformers, local models, etc.) into <ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_prompt_evaluator" kindref="compound">PromptEvaluator</ref> for semantically accurate similarity scoring. </para>
